  "sources": {
    "_about": "SRC-01/02/05/10. Every host a script or workflow contacts or links to. role: fetch = contacted by a fetcher; link = only written into data as a link for visitors; namespace = an RDF/XML namespace, never contacted; self = our own site. robots: what the host's robots.txt said when verified; apiDocs: the provider's own documentation that permits programmatic use of a path robots.txt disallows.",
